The '''Sea Archer''' is an {{Rarity|u|nolink=yes}} [[Sea Creatures|Sea Creature]] that can be fished up from Water.

== Spawning ==
The '''Sea Archer''' can be caught while fishing in [[Water]] if the player has reached {{Skl|Fishing|IX}}.

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for the '''Sea Archer''' is {{Green|550}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|12.80%|1|7.81|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Currently there are no modifiers that can be used to increase it.

